  "description": "every tick of the control law: whether it was called, the drive in force it was told, the drive it asked for, the drive played after every guard (each drive's real and imaginary parts, V peak), the miss, the call's time, the request and its outcome, the caps and scales that bound, and the law's declared values; time from engage; a tick is NaN where a record was not filled",
